只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DSH Git Review — 审查标签页 + 围栏 Git 工作台 | Review tab + fenced git workbench for DeepSeek Harness: file tree, diffs, lane graph, guarded git ops","id":"gh:1358120583","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-git-review","slug":"HaoyueQin/dsh-git-review","topics":["code-review","deepseek-harness","developer-tools","devtools","diff","dsh","dsh-plugin","git","git-graph","productivity","react","typescript"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DSH Git Review — 审查标签页 + 围栏 Git 工作台 | Review tab + fenced git workbench for DeepSeek Harness: file t"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ree, diffs, lane graph, guarded git ops"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# DSH Git Review"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文文档"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A **Review tab plus fenced git workbench** for DeepSeek Harness: everything an agent changed, laid o"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ut for a decision — file tree, diffs, commit graph — with guarded git operations in the same place."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Screenshots"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Changes view — syntax-highlighted file with the filterable tree"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Graph view — commit detail with side-by-side diff and word highlights"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## What it does"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"DSH Git Review registers a **Review** tab next to Chat and Trajectory in the session view. It shows "},{"id":"p9s2","text":"the workspace repository against HEAD — or any two refs — and lets you act on what you see without l"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"epository against HEAD — or any two refs — and lets you act on what you see without leaving the tab:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- **Review first**: filterable file tree with status badges, side-by-side / unified / full-file diff"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"s, hunk folding, word-level change highlights, syntax coloring, and diff search across file names, d"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"iff text, and file content. Keyboard-first: `j`/`k` move between files, `/` focuses search.\n- **Deci"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"de with history**: a lane commit graph with per-commit files and diffs, blame gutters, per-file hist"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"ory, and reading any file version from history.\n- **Act under guard**: stage / unstage / discard per"},{"id":"p10s6","text":" file or per hunk, commit (plus amend, Ctrl+Enter), commit-and-push, and push; branches (create / sw"},{"id":"p10s7","text":"itch / rename / delete / merge / track remotes) with fetch and pull; history operations (reset / rev"},{"id":"p10s8","text":"ert / cherry-pick, per-commit actions from the graph); lightweight tags (create / delete / push); st"},{"id":"p10s9","text":"ash; and merge-conflict resolution (ours / theirs, continue / abort). Every write needs explicit con"},{"id":"p10s10","text":"firmation, destructive ones ask twice, and everything locks while the agent is running.\n- **Close th"},{"id":"p10s11","text":"e loop**: comment on any diff line and drop it into the composer draft, mark files reviewed (auto-cl"},{"id":"p10s12","text":"eared when the file changes again), and keep comment drafts per workspace.\n- **Preview files**: mark"},{"id":"p10s13","text":"down renders with the shell's own Markdown engine, HTML / images / SVG show inline, PDFs open sandbo"},{"id":"p10s14","text":"xed — a script-dependent HTML page gets a notice strip with an open-in-browser shortcut instead of s"},{"id":"p10s15","text":"itting black — every preview has a source view toggle, and office documents open in your external ap"},{"id":"p10s16","text":"ps from the tree's right-click menu.\n- **Picture diffs**: image changes (PNG / JPG / GIF / WebP / BM"},{"id":"p10s17","text":"P / AVIF / ICO / SVG) render as pictures right inside the diff view — 2-up (side by side, or stacked"},{"id":"p10s18","text":" in unified), swipe, onion skin and a difference blend, with the source diff one click away."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Preferences (diff layout, default search scope, graph shape, matching, whitespace, syntax) live in t"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"he harness settings Plugins tab and sync instantly with the Review tab."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"From npm:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Or from a local tarball:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Requires DeepSeek Harness `0.1.2-rc.1` through `0.2.0-rc.1` (prerelease series are pinned one by one"},{"id":"p17s2","text":" in `peerDependencies`) and git on the host PATH. Outside a git repository the tab offers file brows"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"ing with one-click `git init` instead of the review workbench — never a blank screen. Display prefer"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"ences live in the configuration the harness serves for this plugin's entry: its own `.volatile()` fi"},{"id":"p17s5","text":"elds keyed by the profile entry id from `0.1.7-alpha.1` on, the Plugins page's entry for this plugin"},{"id":"p17s6","text":" from `0.1.6-alpha.2` on, or the settings modal's plugin cards before that."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Checks"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"- **Host half**: an in-process cordis plugin serving a fenced prefix route for versioned API actions"},{"id":"p21s2","text":" over JSON (non-JSON bodies get 415, which also closes the classic no-cors write vectors). Every pat"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"h is fenced inside the session workspace repository, every ref is re-resolved server-side, commit id"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"s only travel as 40-hex, and GIT_DIR-style environment hijacks are scrubbed.\n- **Client half**: a co"},{"id":"p21s5","text":"nversation-view slot component; the host route is optional — without it the tab says so instead of e"},{"id":"p21s6","text":"rroring.\n- **Scale guards**: 20k-row render cap, 2 MiB per-file diff cap, 500-commit graph pages wit"},{"id":"p21s7","text":"h load-more, an 8 MiB streaming byte cap on the largest git answers plus a separate 8 MiB preview ca"},{"id":"p21s8","text":"p (both truncate instead of buffering whole), and exact-count probing within a 32 MiB per-status bud"},{"id":"p21s9","text":"get.\n- Interface languages: Simplified Chinese and English, following the harness locale; dark and l"},{"id":"p21s10","text":"ight themes via semantic tokens."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Activity"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"MIT © HaoyueQin"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"The plugin icon reproduces the Git logo by Jason Long, licensed under the\nCreative Commons Attributi"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"on 3.0 Unported License."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
